    "p2_is_special_because": "(u;u)_m vanishes at m = 2p, so p=2 gives the criterion the fewest usable indices of any prime (three) and caps the divisor's valuation at 4. The same shortness makes direct evaluation trivial there — worst prime for the criterion, best for evaluation.",
